{title: 407 - Sent Forth by God's Blessing}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #407 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 407}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C7]Sent [F]forth by God's [Am]blessing, [Dm]Our [Gm]true faith con[C]fessing,
[C7]The [F]people of [Bb]God from His [F]dwelling [C7]take [F]leave.
[C7]The [F]supper is [Am]ended. [Dm]Oh, [Gm]now be ex[C]tended
[C7]The [F]fruits of this [Bb]service in [F]all who [C7]be[F]lieve.
[C7]The [F]seed of His teaching, Re[C7]ceptive souls reaching,
[C7]Shall [F]blossom in action [Dm]for [C]God and [G7]for [C]all.
[C7]His [F]grace did in[Am]vite us, [Dm]His [Gm]love shall u[C]nite us
[C7]To [F]work for God's [Bb]kingdom and [F]answer [C7]His [F]call.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C7]With [F]praise and [Am]thanks [Dm]giving To [Gm]God [C]ever living,
[C7]The [F]tasks of [Bb]our [F]everyday life [C7]we [F]will face.
[C7]Our [F]faith [Am]ever sharing, [Dm]In [Gm]love [C]ever caring,
[C7]Embracing [F]His [Bb]children of [F]each [C7]tribe [F]and race.
[C7]With Your feast You [F]feed us, With Your [C7]light now lead us;
[C7]Unite [F]us as [Dm]one in [C]this [G7]life that [C]we share.
[C7]Then [F]may all [Am]the living [Dm]With [Gm]praise and [C]thanks giving
[C7]Give [F]honor to [Bb]Christ and [F]His [C7]name that [F]we bear.
{end_of_verse}
